# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Artefato efêmero gerado pelo workflow sync-talks-on-event-day (notificação Power Automate)
moved-talks.json

